.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH choom-clients 1  "choom-clients " 
.SH NAME
choom\-clients \- List the viewers of your session
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBchoom\-clients\fR [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-identity\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-default\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the viewers of your session
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-identity\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Identity key used to create the session (must match the host\*(Aqs key)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-default\-key\fR
The host did not use the bundled default key
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  List the viewers of your active session:
      choom clients
